{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はちゃんと充電したぞ～！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！28回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nはふ～んwさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたの冒頭あいさつもお待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンギン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳当て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気に入り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたもしていこーっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の皆さんからのコメントをみて\nすごく心があたたかくなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりみなさんの力って\nすごいなーって感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがいないと私は\nここにいられないんだなって\n本当に感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここで、私の思いをダラダラとかいても\nきっと私の思いの全部は\nみなさんに伝えきれないから\n全部全部伝わるように私は\n目に見える形で皆さんに感謝の気持ちを\n返していきたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直接あって伝えたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんがだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は9日の個別握手会の服を載せます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部と2部は巫女さんを着ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部の髪型はストレートで\n2部は１つにくくりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この御幣は\n生誕委員の方々が用意してくれてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンも神社みたいになってて\n私のレーンの神社の名前は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「五星神社」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「サンクエトワール」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかけてくれました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーブルにもかわいい小物がたくさんあって\nテンションがあがりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつもありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのお祓いや\nおみくじや占いをしたりして\nいつもより皆さんと遊んだ握手会でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと笑ってた！\nヘラヘラしてた！楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部がチェックのワンピースに\n白いモハモハのパーカーきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペンギンの耳当ても初登場！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛が伸びてきて\n外ハネの形が変わってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよう！切るか切らないか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まようよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/11/2414921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n21回目はひろっぴ(生ちゃん命名)さんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今北野充電中！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(今日の冒頭あいさつとおわりのあいさつは妹が選んでくれました♪笑\nブログ毎日更新してるから家族も巻き込むという新しい感じ